      "text": "Deep down, I always knew that was true."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "But today, you helped me remember it, Kite."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "At first, I was hoping that I could save my father."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "But Byron Arclight really had become someone else."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Vetrix was obsessed with his desire to get revenge against Dr. Faker."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I got caught up in his plans for vengeance. I felt it was my duty as his son."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "It isn't. Once I save Hart, I'm going to confront my father."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "And not only that, I'll do what you couldn't do!"
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I'll stop Vetrix's quest for revenge just like you wanted!"
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "You've grown strong, Kite."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I am proud to have been your teacher."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Goodbye, Kite."
